OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,6,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers follow from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest through the day. Outbreaks
OL,9,Fgenerally confined over Argyll and
OL,10,Fturning wintry here later to low
OL,11,Flevels.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIsolated showers initially,
OL,14,Ffocused over Argyll, otherwise mainly
OL,15,Fdry with clear spells and light winds
OL,16,Fbringing a frosty start to the week
OL,17,Ffor many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
