OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCold. Frosty start for many.
OL,6,FSunny spells. Most dry but showers in
OL,7,Ffar north during the morning. Higher
OL,8,Fcloud feeding from south for afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,11,FTuesday brings periods of rain and
OL,12,Fhill snow, which turns heavy at times.
OL,13,FWednesday rather cloudy with some
OL,14,Fpatchy rain.Thursday frosty, dry and
OL,15,Fbright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
